    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the smallest ideas are the most thoughtful. Fill Multicolor has a very simple premise, you are presented with a grid of dots and you must connect all the dots. Sounds easy? But wait! There are two-color dots that require certain rules inorder to be connected. Dots cannot be connected twice. You must connect all the dots(Obviously). All this combines to make an addictive puzzle game that brightens your brain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Levels with gradually increasing difficulty</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve over 1,250+ levels. You can play this addictive puzzle game in various difficulty packs. Each level pack has multiple levels with an increasing challenge. Want the real challenge? Boost your brain by playing the ultimate difficult levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Fill Multicolor</strong> is just like the classic connect the dots game but without numbers or structure to guide you and with a new mechanic concept.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Start from the initial dot, then connect all open dots on the board ending in the last dot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Connections are made vertically or horizontally and without overlap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Don\u2019t forget the two-color dots, they are tricky and the new feature that AleC Games added to this kind of dot to dot puzzle games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use hints for puzzles that are too hard to solve. Hints are also free, of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Don\u2019t get too cozy\u2014the puzzles get harder as you go along.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Minimalist design: beautiful colors, awesome sound effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Smart level design: more than 1250 handcrafted smart levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf 22 Awesome dots design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf You can play Fill Multicolor by AleC Games on your phone and tablet.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the smallest ideas are the most thoughtful. Fill Multicolor has a very simple premise, you are presented with a grid of dots and you must connect all the dots. Sounds easy? But wait! There are two-color dots that require certain rules inorder to be connected. Dots cannot be connected twice. You must connect all the dots(Obviously). All this combines to make an addictive puzzle game that brightens your brain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Levels with gradually increasing difficulty</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve over 1,250+ levels. You can play this addictive puzzle game in various difficulty packs. Each level pack has multiple levels with an increasing challenge. Want the real challenge? Boost your brain by playing the ultimate difficult levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Fill Multicolor</strong> is just like the classic connect the dots game but without numbers or structure to guide you and with a new mechanic concept.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Start from the initial dot, then connect all open dots on the board ending in the last dot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Connections are made vertically or horizontally and without overlap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Don\u2019t forget the two-color dots, they are tricky and the new feature that AleC Games added to this kind of dot to dot puzzle games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Use hints for puzzles that are too hard to solve. Hints are also free, of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Don\u2019t get too cozy\u2014the puzzles get harder as you go along.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Minimalist design: beautiful colors, awesome sound effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Smart level design: more than 1250 handcrafted smart levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf 22 Awesome dots design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf You can play Fill Multicolor by AleC Games on your phone and tablet.</p>",
